# egress-proxy allowlist (example)
# One host per line. Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored.
# Matching is DOT-BOUNDARY: an entry "example.com" allows "example.com" and
# any subdomain "*.example.com" (e.g. api.example.com) but NOT
# "evilexample.com" or "example.com.attacker.com". Case-insensitive.
#
# Build this list by running the proxy in `observe` mode first, then reading
# the destinations out of egress.log (the JSONL "host" field).

# --- Anthropic / Claude API (OpenClaw cloud coder) ---
api.anthropic.com

# --- OpenAI (if used) ---
api.openai.com

# --- BlackWall / BlueTier infra ---
blackwalltier.com
bluetieroperations.com

# --- Common package / update hosts an agent may legitimately need ---
# pypi.org
# files.pythonhosted.org
# github.com
# raw.githubusercontent.com
